  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2024-07-31T21:50:59Z\"\u003e1 August 2024\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  Antarctica New Zealand Board appointment\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"teaser--small minister taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-ministers taxonomy-term--view-mode-teaser-small ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \u003ca href=\"/minister/rt-hon-winston-peters\" class=\"field-group-link minister__link\" hreflang=\"en\"\u003e    \n      \u003cdiv class=\"field minister__portrait\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\n  \n  \n            \u003cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e  \u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail/public/2023-12/Peters.png?itok=Uk86zxEs\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" alt=\"Winston Peters portrait\" class=\"img-responsive\"/\u003e\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n  \n\n    \n      \u003cdiv class=\"field minister__title\"\u003e  Rt Hon Winston Peters\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\u003c/a\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tag taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-portfolios taxonomy-term--view-mode-teaser-small ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    \u003ca href=\"/portfolio/nationalactnew-zealand-first-coalition-government-2023-2026/foreign-affairs\" hreflang=\"en\"\u003eForeign Affairs\u003c/a\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForeign Minister Winston Peters has appointed Keiran Horne to the Board of Antarctica New Zealand.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMs Horne will bring to the Board extensive expertise in audit and assurance, following a career as an insolvency practitioner. She also has broad governance experience, including in the government sector.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e“Ms Horne’s expertise will be a further asset to the Board as it works to progress the Scott Base Redevelopment project in an effective and efficient manner,” Mr Peters says.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "Foreign Minister Winston Peters has appointed Keiran Horne to the Board of Antarctica New Zealand. Ms Horne will bring to the Board extensive expertise in audit and assurance, following a career as an insolvency practitioner. She also has broad governance experience, including in the government sector. “Ms Horne’s expertise will be a further asset to the Board as it works to progress the Scott Base Redevelopment project in an effective and efficient manner,” Mr Peters says.",
